OL,3,AAnti-migrant activist arrested over
OL,4,Avideo of dinghy slashing
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnti-migrant activist Daniel Thomas has
OL,7,Fbeen arrested over a video appearing to
OL,8,Fshow him slashing at a boat in the
OL,9,FEnglish Channel with a knife.
OL,11,FHampshire and Isle of Wight
OL,12,FConstabulary said a 37-year-old man of
OL,13,Fno fixed abode had been arrested after
OL,14,Fa "boat that had an emergency responder
OL,15,Fon board" was damaged in the Channel.
OL,17,FHe was arrested on suspicion of
OL,18,Fcriminal damage with intent to endanger
OL,19,Flife and endangering the safety of a
OL,20,Fship on Wednesday. He remains in
OL,21,Fcustody.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
